---
// Quiz figure for the Backtest post: FillTimeline. Inline SVG, site tokens only, no ids.
---
<div class="qfig-atq12-filltimeline">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 216" role="img" aria-label="A timeline of days t-1, t and t+1 with a marker at the close of day t. An unshifted backtest uses that close for the signal and also credits day t&#x27;s return to it. A shifted backtest credits day t+1&#x27;s return to the signal.">
<text x="10" y="20" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>The close of day t: who earns which return</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giá đóng cửa ngày t: ai kiếm lợi suất nào</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="92" width="170" height="40" rx="6" class="box" />
<text x="105" y="117" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>day t−1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngày t−1</tspan></text>
<rect x="200" y="92" width="170" height="40" rx="6" class="box" />
<text x="285" y="117" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>day t</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngày t</tspan></text>
<rect x="380" y="92" width="170" height="40" rx="6" class="box" />
<text x="465" y="117" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>day t+1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngày t+1</tspan></text>
<line x1="190" y1="84" x2="190" y2="140" class="ln" />
<line x1="370" y1="84" x2="370" y2="140" class="ln" />
<text x="370" y="152" class="s" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>close of day t</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đóng cửa ngày t</tspan></text>
<line x1="370" y1="62" x2="285" y2="62" class="redl" /><polygon points="276,62 286,57 286,67" class="redf" />
<text x="370" y="44" class="t13 redt" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Unshifted: the same close gives the signal and earns day t</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không shift: cùng giá đóng cửa vừa cho tín hiệu vừa kiếm lợi suất ngày t</tspan></text>
<line x1="370" y1="176" x2="455" y2="176" class="goldl" /><polygon points="464,176 454,171 454,181" class="goldf" />
<text x="370" y="200" class="t13 goldt" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Shifted: the signal at the close of day t earns day t+1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Có shift: tín hiệu lúc đóng cửa ngày t kiếm lợi suất ngày t+1</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline svg { display: block; width: 100%;  height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .t13 { font-size: 13px; }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .goldt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .okb { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .badb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .arrf { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .redl { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .goldl { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .mutl { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .goldf { fill: var(--gold); }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .mutf { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline .hole { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-atq12-filltimeline figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
